amd/RyzenAI-SW's own utilities/npu_check (github.com/amd/RyzenAI-SW, utilities/npu_check),
cloned and built locally (CMake + VS 2022 Build Tools, Release config; needed the
"C++ Spectre-mitigated libs" individual component added via an elevated
vs_installer.exe modify, /Qspectre in this project's CMakeLists requires it). Not part
of this repo's own pipelines -- an official AMD compatibility-check utility, run here to
corroborate the driver/device findings already used throughout results/aie/ with a
second, independent tool.

